            <div xml:id="d618">

                <pb facs="0729" n="631" xml:id="pg631"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.51/2658: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in China</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Tenney</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-02-12T17:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">February 12,
                                1920—5 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>39. Your 37, February 10, 6 p.m.</p>
                <p>Department fully approves your insistence upon joint negotiations and joint
                    signature of the loan agreement by the four national groups.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
